Use the existing Vulkan-Hpp RAII instance dispatcher for every physical-device
query. This removes two accidental direct loader references and lets CMake use
the header-only Vulkan target for its existing dynamic-loader implementation.
Require the Vulkan-Headers config package for this dynamic implementation.
This does not repair an installed Vulkan loader or claim Vulkan runtime support.
Origin: AI-assisted EmberBSD portability work; not submitted upstream.

